      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَرَكَّتِ السَّمَآءُ</span></b>  <i>The sky rained such rain as is
termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رِكّ</span>; (S, K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَكَّكَت</span></b> . (Ibn-
'Abbád, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُرِكَّتِ الأَرْضُ</span> <i>The land was
rained upon with such rain as is termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رِكّ</span>, (S,)
or <i>with such rains as are termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رِكَاك</span>; as also
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رُكِّكَت</span></b> . (TA.)

